    "detailed_description": "It's the year 2042.<br><br>You are a B.E.C. A Bionically Enhanced Collector, employed by Earth\u2019s global employment agency, Collector Corp. <br><br>Your life is on the verge of a life-changing transformation with the arrival of the Sentians, a mysterious extraterrestrial race. Will you become the unexpected hero that Earth desperately needs?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ALIEN WARFARE</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453990/extras/b5842723878f44b08e35308e37bcaa10.poster.avif?t=1714751777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453990/extras/b5842723878f44b08e35308e37bcaa10.webm?t=1714751777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453990/extras/b5842723878f44b08e35308e37bcaa10.mp4?t=1714751777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Fight head-on with your bionic abilities, or target enemies from a distance with a wide range of customizable weapons.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE FUTURISTIC EARTH</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453990/extras/6c0e1de451a60e0907dc505f841ff712.poster.avif?t=1714751777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453990/extras/6c0e1de451a60e0907dc505f841ff712.webm?t=1714751777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453990/extras/6c0e1de451a60e0907dc505f841ff712.mp4?t=1714751777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Discover all sorts of mysteries during your adventure in a stylized semi-open world. From a beautiful forest to a dark crater or an icy mountain. The world is yours to explore.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BACKPACK COMPANION</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453990/extras/0fc875f4c84537de67caca3c1a60f463.poster.avif?t=1714751777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453990/extras/0fc875f4c84537de67caca3c1a60f463.webm?t=1714751777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453990/extras/0fc875f4c84537de67caca3c1a60f463.mp4?t=1714751777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You're not alone in your adventure, you have a dynamic transformable backpack that can transform in many ways, including a Jetpack!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DYNAMIC SEASONS</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453990/extras/9f35a2af4ba312a9e68595e301debb95.poster.avif?t=1714751777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453990/extras/9f35a2af4ba312a9e68595e301debb95.webm?t=1714751777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453990/extras/9f35a2af4ba312a9e68595e301debb95.mp4?t=1714751777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The world of INSPIRE has a dynamic seasonal system. Find out how the world changes each day and night.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BATTLE SYSTEM</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453990/extras/c7254041c2bee3cdfb7b28765702f818.poster.avif?t=1714751777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453990/extras/c7254041c2bee3cdfb7b28765702f818.webm?t=1714751777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453990/extras/c7254041c2bee3cdfb7b28765702f818.mp4?t=1714751777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Your actions influence all kinds of dynamic events during your playtime, tracked by the game\u2019s Battle System.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE SOUND OF INSPIRE</strong></h2>Enjoy an epic electronic soundtrack, created by Husman.",
